# QA flow trigger

If the user says any of:

- "run the qa flow"
- "run QA" / "run qa"
- "qa flow"
- "run the QA suite"
- "smoke test production" / "verify production with QA"

Then:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/qa-flow/SKILL.md` immediately.
2. Run `npm run qa` from the repo root (unless they specified flags like `--local`).
3. Summarize pass/fail. Do not deploy to production. Do not ask whether to run — just run it.
